# Persian locale for fa products

## Calendar

- User-facing dates are **Jalali (شمسی)**.
- DB stores Gregorian timezone-aware datetimes.
- Use `{% load persian %}{{ dt|jalali }}` or `apps.common.persian.format_jalali`.

## Money (shops)

- Default currency label: **تومان**.
- Always thousand-separate: `{{ price|toman }}` → `185,000 تومان`.
- Convert ×10 to ریال only at payment gateway calls.

## UI (mandatory for fa screens)

- Follow skill **`persian-ui`**: complete RTL compositions, Vazirmatn/Estedad, Persian chrome, no starter English, no Latin deco heroes.
- Pair with `ui-ux` quality bar before calling a page done.

See skills: `persian-ui`, `persian-locale`, `persian-ecommerce`, `ui-ux`.
